, "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Are you ready for this, Commander Yurik?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "This will be a difficult task for my Dragoons, Captain Tucker.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "For a Dragoon force? You guys are legends. The finest warriors the world has ever seen. You live for the honor of combat.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "That is the problem. This is a meaningless diversion, not a suitable enemy.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "These troops are outliers of a fearsome enemy force. If we don't deal with them accordingly, we run the risk of endangering our own forces.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Fine. The faster we dispatch these distractions, the more quickly we will be able to stop Durand, and perhaps free his people from their delusions.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "You Dragoons are almost surreal. Guaranteed victory against your most bitter enemy, and you're still concerned about the honor of the battlefield.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Soon we will see a return for our people to the homeland. I would not have it tarnished by any manner of shame.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "So... I guess you guys are sort of rusty on the whole war thing, right?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Impressive as always, Commander.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "I cannot celebrate such an uneven victory. They could never have defeated us.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "The closer we get to the Akadian center, the more dangerous this assault will become. I have a feeling Durand isn't out of tricks yet.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "My Dragoons have a few surprises for him as well. He has not faced us in a very long time, and we have learned our lessons well.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'm glad you're on our team, Yurik. To be frank, you can be a pretty intimidating guy.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Thank you. Years of practice.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}